494 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many users struggle to understand which bank offers the best financing option for their salary and budget. They often have to visit multiple bank websites or branches to compare offers, which is time-consuming and confusing. This highlights the need for a unified system that allows users to explore and compare bank offers easily in one place.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
