503 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Many users spend excessive time repeatedly checking for new listings that fit their budget or preferences, and they often miss strong opportunities because those listings appear after their last visit. This indicates a clear need for a proactive, event-driven alert mechanism that surfaces relevant properties the moment they become available.)
/Pg 35 0 R
