610 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To solve the issue of choosing the right financing option, the design includes a dedicated section that presents banks in an organized way, showing interest rates, financing details, and eligibility requirements. It also introduces the general idea of helping users better understand and compare available options in one place, without needing to switch between multiple sources.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
611 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The design also solves the problem of missing good property opportunities through an instant notification system based on user preferences. Users receive alerts as soon as a property that matches their criteria becomes available, reducing wasted time and ensuring that no suitable opportunity is overlooked.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
612 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To address the lack of trust in property listings, the design incorporates a reliable rating and review system that allows users to view real feedback and previous experiences. Additionally, the built-in messaging feature enables direct communication with sellers and agencies, enhancing transparency and increasing trust in the platform.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
613 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Overall, the design demonstrates how these problems and needs are transformed into practical and effective solutions, making the property-search experience more reliable, transparent, and user-friendly.)
/Pg 45 0 R
/K [5]
>>
