664 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (At the beginning of the project, we identified several major issues that users face in real estate platforms, such as inaccurate and outdated property listings, weak communication between buyers and agents, and the difficulty of comparing mortgage options. These problems caused confusion, reduced trust, and made the property-search process slower and less reliable.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
665 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Through interviews and online surveys, we gathered clear insights from buyers, renters, agents, and property owners. Their feedback highlighted the need for accurate information, faster updates, trustworthy reviews, and easier access to financial details. This user research helped us understand the real challenges and guided our design decisions.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
666 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To solve these issues, we designed Aqari with features that directly address user needs. We added verified listings and a full rating system to build trust, introduced smart notifications to prevent users from missing new property opportunities, and created a financing section that allows users to compare bank offers, calculate installments, and contact banks directly.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We then enhanced the overall user experience by building simple, intuitive interfaces and adding an in-app messaging system that improves communication. By transforming real user problems into effective solutions, Aqari delivers a more efficient, transparent, and trustworthy real estate platform.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
